 R←Test_Dir2_035(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;path;list
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method recursively with wildcards
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 path←'Tests\Test Dir'
 list←1⊃('recurse' 1)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 path,'\'
 →T.PassesIf 14=≢list
 list←⊃('recurse' 1)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 path,'\sha*.*'
 →T.PassesIf 3=≢list
 →T.PassesIf∧/'sha'{⍺∘≡¨(≢⍺)↑¨⍵}2⊃∘⎕NPARTS¨{⍵/⍨##.FilesAndDirs.IsFile ⍵}list
 list←1⊃('recurse' 1)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 path,'\*.log'
 →T.PassesIf 6=≢list
 →T.PassesIf∧/'.log'∘≡¨3⊃∘⎕NPARTS¨{⍵/⍨##.FilesAndDirs.IsFile ⍵}list

 R←T._OK
